# Data and storage

- Map cities live in `src/utils/citiesConfig`. Poland keeps its SVG shape fields; a city correction changes `name`, `coord`, and `title` only.
- Add a new HTTP call in `src/services/api` and export it from that folder's index. Keys come from `import.meta.env` (`VITE_*`). Never commit `.env`.
- `localStorage` stores the theme only under `THEME_DATA_KEY` (`meteofy-is-dark-theme`). Accept the strings `"true"` and `"false"`. A missing or broken value uses the system preference and is saved. `toggleThemeMode` writes the opposite value.
